            "review_text": "Tarunjeet R\nBengaluru, India145 contributions\n0\nGreat nightlife vibe !\nNov 2022 • Family\nHo  chi Minh has a great vibe in the evenings. And what makes it great are the vibing outlets, casual approach and awesome food.\n\nHowever if you are a nibbler or medium eater , be mindful of the number of dishes you order. The portions are hugeeeee ! We enjoyed the food and drinks and the lovely hospitality of the staff. They took extra effort to help us understand what to order and what we couldn't communicate they googled.\n\nGo dressed in your best or in flip flops. Both are welcome here with a smile.\nRead more\nWritten November 17, 2022",
