            "review_text": "Kirk Patrick Peralta\nCalgary, Canada32 contributions\n0\nHad a fantastic experience\nDec 2019 • Couples\nHad a fantastic experience at this restaurant located near the ben thanh market. We had a quick stop at this restaurant to have dinner and wasn't upset about what we had. We ordered a bowl of beef pho, 3 oysters with butter, \"shaky beef\" , and vietnamese spring rolls for our appetizer. This is a great place for people who love to drink and chill. They also have an awesome bar where you can casually meet other tourists and locals as well.\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2019",
