            "review_title": "Review at Tan Lap Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Rob Puco\n1 contribution\n0\nWorst food and service in Vietnam\nSep 2019 • Couples\nAfter 2 weeks in Vietnam this is easily the worst meal so far. Totally clueless staff which seem to be put out that we actually wanted to order their food! My wife asked for sliced lime for her pho and I the young “waiter” point to some on another table and walked away to sit down again to chat and joke to the other “waiters”, he was particularly woeful. My beef salad too forever to come out, other people came in after I had ordered it and got their food first, and It was poor. I told the staff that didn’t like it but was told they couldn’t do anything about it. Food was expensive, below average and horrendous service. Don’t eat here.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 17, 2019",
