            "review_text": "Vincent V\nBelgium6 contributions\n0\nBy far the worst food experience in whole Vietnam\nMay 2019 • Couples\nOk, first make note tripadvisor doesn't let me give them 0 stars so it's even worse than 1/5. Service is really bad, and so is the food. After travelling a month in Vietnam from north to south this is the first time I came out of a restaurant feeling sick. The food was poor and didn't tasted good at al. The price is also very high for what you get.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 29, 2019",
