            "review_text": "Jamie P\nLondon, United Kingdom100 contributions\n0\n272 Tan Lap - worse service recurved\nApr 2019 • Couples\nAfter walking up the the very back of the restaurant ( no front of house ) they agreed to let us eat there on the final table available, there was a large party on a big table with one more reserved and another big table of 6. We were seated for 15 minutes as we watched waiters standing around drinking water and chefs coming from the back to deliver food, after this time has past we had had enough and left after no interest given to us at all, we are young travellers and it was made apparent to us they did not need our smaller business; too many staff and too little doing, the service was awful which has been also stated in other reviews before we entered.\nRead more\nWritten April 13, 2019",
